    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Palace of Auburn Hills arena opened in 1988 for $90 million, became home to the Detroit Pistons and hosted concerts, boosting local entertainment.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Auburn_Hills,_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Oakland University’s campus, once a Nike missile base, now anchors the city’s higher‑education presence and drives housing demand.",
